e2/node3 via apt-installed etcd-server with static bootstrap discovery over their peer URLs. Verified cross-member consistency (write on node1, read confirmed on node2/node3), verified continued availability under a single-member outage (stopped node3, wrote/read successfully via node1+node2 at 2/3 quorum), and verified node3 fully caught up on rejoin. Then executed the mandatory one-at-a-time node restart protocol on all three nodes: captured a healthy baseline (boot_id + etcd active + data present) on each, issued a background-scheduled reboot on each node individually (quorum preserved throughout, never more than one node down), polled until reachable, confirmed a changed boot_id proving an actual reboot occurred, and confirmed etcd active, cluster membership at 3/3, endpoint health true for all endpoints, and prior keys readable post-restart.\",\"actions_performed\":[\"Inspected all three nodes (Ubuntu 24.04.3, no etcd preinstalled)\",\"Installed etcd-server/etcd-client via apt on node1, node2, node3\",\"Configured /etc/default/etcd on each node with ETCD_NAME, peer/client URLs, and identical ETCD_INITIAL_CLUSTER for static 3-member bootstrap\",\"Started etcd on all three nodes; confirmed 3/3 members 'started' and healthy via etcdctl member list / endpoint health\",\"Wrote key on node1, confirmed readable from node2 and node3\",\"Stopped etcd on node3 to simulate member unavailability; wrote and read a key via node1/node2 while node3 was down, confirming quorum preserved\",\"Restarted etcd on node3; confirmed it caught up on the key written during its downtime and cluster returned to 3/3 healthy\",\"Captured pre-restart boot_id, etcd active state, and data presence on all three nodes as baseline\",\"Rebooted node1 via backgrounded reboot command (ack returned before disconnect), polled until reachable, confirmed new boot_id, confirmed etcd active and 3/3 cluster health with data intact\",\"Rebooted node2 the same way; confirmed new boot_id and full recovery\",\"Rebooted node3 the same way; confirmed new boot_id and full recovery, with all cluster members and both test keys present\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"3-member etcd cluster formed across node1/node2/node3\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-9000a0eb82b2434e\"],\"summary\":\"etcdctl member list shows all 3 members (node1/node2/node3) with status 'started' and endpoint health true for all three client endpoints\"},{\"requirement\":\"Key written through any member is readable from the others\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-176d8fb6108e4f36\"],\"summary\":\"Wrote benchmark-key via node1's endpoint, then read it successfully from node2's and node3's endpoints\"},{\"requirement\":\"Cluster keeps serving reads/writes while one member is unavailable\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-4bc201ace95f45fe\",\"cmd-44ad925ebfa040c4\"],\"summary\":\"Stopped etcd on node3, then successfully wrote 'during-outage' key via node1 and read it back via node2, with endpoint health true for the two remaining members\"},{\"requirement\":\"Unavailable member catches up when it returns\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-baa9d98e5a1e4ede\",\"cmd-432cf493a6114046\"],\"summary\":\"Restarted etcd on node3; it reported active, then successfully returned the 'during-outage' key written while it was down, and all 3 members showed healthy\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 restart: healthy baseline\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-98a55005739a4c02\"],\"summary\":\"Captured boot_id df9e2dce..., etcd ActiveState=active/SubState=running, and successful read of during-outage key on node1 before reboot\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 restart: acknowledgement and changed boot identity\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-5d5c2942cb834809\",\"cmd-9a82d617d70b4bb3\",\"cmd-0909b2a13fcf446f\"],\"summary\":\"Reboot command acknowledged before disconnect; node1 unreachable during reboot; boot_id changed to 17d44014... confirming an actual restart\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 restart: recovered state\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-46b742ebc6494285\"],\"summary\":\"Post-reboot: etcd active, during-outage key readable, all 3 endpoints healthy, member list shows 3/3 started\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 restart: healthy baseline\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-7db28837bd344533\"],\"summary\":\"Captured boot_id 37344ae4..., etcd active/running, and successful key read on node2 before reboot\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 restart: acknowledgement and changed boot identity\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-a339fc89d5fe4fc7\",\"cmd-b444b3d6c2064b36\",\"cmd-4d9df19f895c4663\"],\"summary\":\"Reboot acknowledged before disconnect; node2 unreachable during reboot; boot_id changed to 6cf74869... confirming restart\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 restart: recovered state\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-534cf3e069844ebc\"],\"summary\":\"Post-reboot: etcd active, during-outage key readable, all 3 endpoints healthy\"},{\"requirement\":\"node3 restart: healthy baseline\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-714b5836553a4ab3\"],\"summary\":\"Captured boot_id 92ec88af..., etcd active/running, and successful key read on node3 before reboot\"},{\"requirement\":\"node3 restart: acknowledgement and changed boot identity\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-e9e82b2f2db94c98\",\"cmd-910344605dfd4f87\",\"cmd-17752998d0d14192\"],\"summary\":\"Reboot acknowledged before disconnect; node3 unreachable during reboot; boot_id changed to 371d3692... confirming restart\"},{\"requirement\":\"node3 restart: recovered state, full cluster and data integrity\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-a8f75cdad7a24efb\"],\"summary\":\"Post-reboot: etcd active, during-outage and benchmark-key both readable, all 3 endpoints healthy, member list 3/3 started\"}]}","structured_output":{"status":"completed","summary":"Deployed a 3-member etcd cluster (v3.4.30) across node1/node2/node3 via apt-installed etcd-server with static bootstrap discovery over their peer URLs. Verified cross-member consistency (write on node1, read confirmed on node2/node3), verified continued availability under a single-member outage (stopped node3, wrote/read successfully via node1+node2 at 2/3 quorum), and verified node3 fully caught up on rejoin. Then executed the mandatory one-at-a-time node restart protocol on all three nodes: captured a healthy baseline (boot_id + etcd active + data present) on each, issued a background-scheduled reboot on each node individually (quorum preserved throughout, never more than one node down), polled until reachable, confirmed a changed boot_id proving an actual reboot occurred, and confirmed etcd active, cluster membership at 3/3, endpoint health true for all endpoints, and prior keys readable post-restart.","actions_performed":["Inspected all three nodes (Ubuntu 24.04.3, no etcd preinstalled)","Installed etcd-server/etcd-client via apt on node1, node2, node3","Configured /etc/default/etcd on each node with ETCD_NAME, peer/client URLs, and identical ETCD_INITIAL_CLUSTER for static 3-member bootstrap","Started etcd on all three nodes; confirmed 3/3 members 'started' and healthy via etcdctl member list / endpoint health","Wrote key on node1, confirmed readable from node2 and node3","Stopped etcd on node3 to simulate member unavailability; wrote and read a key via node1/node2 while node3 was down, confirming quorum preserved","Restarted etcd on node3; confirmed it caught up on the key written during its downtime and cluster returned to 3/3 healthy","Captured pre-restart boot_id, etcd active state, and data presence on all three nodes as baseline","Rebooted node1 via backgrounded reboot command (ack returned before disconnect), polled until reachable, confirmed new boot_id, confirmed etcd active and 3/3 cluster health with data intact","Rebooted node2 the same way; confirmed new boot_id and full recovery","Rebooted node3 the same way; confirmed new boot_id and full recovery, with all cluster members and both test keys present"],"evidence":[{"requirement":"3-member etcd cluster formed across node1/node2/node3","command_ids":["cmd-9000a0eb82b2434e"],"summary":"etcdctl member list shows all 3 members (node1/node2/node3) with status 'started' and endpoint health true for all three client endpoints"},{"requirement":"Key written through any member is readable from the others","command_ids":["cmd-176d8fb6108e4f36"],"summary":"Wrote benchmark-key via node1's endpoint, then read it successfully from node2's and node3's endpoints"},{"requirement":"Cluster keeps serving reads/writes while one member is unavailable","command_ids":["cmd-4bc201ace95f45fe","cmd-44ad925ebfa040c4"],"summary":"Stopped etcd on node3, then successfully wrote 'during-outage' key via node1 and read it back via node2, with endpoint health true for the two remaining members"},{"requirement":"Unavailable member catches up when it returns","command_ids":["cmd-baa9d98e5a1e4ede","cmd-432cf493a6114046"],"summary":"Restarted etcd on node3; it reported active, then successfully returned the 'during-outage' key written while it was down, and all 3 members showed healthy"},{"requirement":"node1 restart: healthy baseline","command_ids":["cmd-98a55005739a4c02"],"summary":"Captured boot_id df9e2dce..., etcd ActiveState=active/SubState=running, and successful read of during-outage key on node1 before reboot"},{"requirement":"node1 restart: acknowledgement and changed boot identity","command_ids":["cmd-5d5c2942cb834809","cmd-9a82d617d70b4bb3","cmd-0909b2a13fcf446f"],"summary":"Reboot command acknowledged before disconnect; node1 unreachable during reboot; boot_id changed to 17d44014... confirming an actual restart"},{"requirement":"node1 restart: recovered state","command_ids":["cmd-46b742ebc6494285"],"summary":"Post-reboot: etcd active, during-outage key readable, all 3 endpoints healthy, member list shows 3/3 started"},{"requirement":"node2 restart: healthy baseline","command_ids":["cmd-7db28837bd344533"],"summary":"Captured boot_id 37344ae4..., etcd active/running, and successful key read on node2 before reboot"},{"requirement":"node2 restart: acknowledgement and changed boot identity","command_ids":["cmd-a339fc89d5fe4fc7","cmd-b444b3d6c2064b36","cmd-4d9df19f895c4663"],"summary":"Reboot acknowledged before disconnect; node2 unreachable during reboot; boot_id changed to 6cf74869... confirming restart"},{"requirement":"node2 restart: recovered state","command_ids":["cmd-534cf3e069844ebc"],"summary":"Post-reboot: etcd active, during-outage key readable, all 3 endpoints healthy"},{"requirement":"node3 restart: healthy baseline","command_ids":["cmd-714b5836553a4ab3"],"summary":"Captured boot_id 92ec88af..., etcd active/running, and successful key read on node3 before reboot"},{"requirement":"node3 restart: acknowledgement and changed boot identity","command_ids":["cmd-e9e82b2f2db94c98","cmd-910344605dfd4f87","cmd-17752998d0d14192"],"summary":"Reboot acknowledged before disconnect; node3 unreachable during reboot; boot_id changed to 371d3692... confirming restart"},{"requirement":"node3 restart: recovered state, full cluster and data integrity","command_ids":["cmd-a8f75cdad7a24efb"],"summary":"Post-reboot: etcd active, during-outage and benchmark-key both readable, all 3 endpoints healthy, member list 3/3 started"}]},"ttft_ms":1555,"type":"result","duration_ms":270176,"uuid":"7844a63c-1770-48a0-9b48-6e55569945df","ttft_stream_ms":946,"time_to_request_ms":46,"first_content_frame_ms":1551,"queued_turn_count":0}
